        "created_at": "2015-11-30T13:53:31.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I doubt it happens before the game ends.</p><p>I'd love to see a contest after the end of the game, just to keep some new content coming, but the work to profit ratio probably would be too low for it to be worthwhile.</p>",
