        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Yeah, at this point the number of contributions would be significant. GtG received far more contributions than they expected for the villains contest, and that was when there were fewer fans and far less fan-created content already out there. There would be a lot of work to dig through the submissions.&nbsp;</p><p>When the game is complete, they&nbsp;<strong><em>might</em> </strong>allow fan-created content on the site. <em><strong>If </strong></em>that happens, we might be able to do a community managed contest.&nbsp;</p>",
